    "seo": {
      "title": "U.S. Vegetable & Potato Exports: Who Buys Them & Foreign Tariffs",
      "shortDescription": "The U.S. exported $4.97 billion of vegetables, potatoes and dry pulses in 2025; Canada bought 59%. See the top buyers, products and what each charges.",
